cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this app, please cite it and the works it builds on, listed under references.
type: software
title: Spatially Variable Genes
abstract: 'Finds the genes whose expression has a spatial pattern in spatial transcriptomics data: per sample, Moran''s
  I (and optionally Geary''s C) on the spatial neighbour graph with squidpy, analytic or permutation p-values and
  Benjamini-Hochberg FDR, and a consensus ranking over samples, with figures. Part of the Pennsieve spatial transcriptomics
  workflows.'
authors:
- name: Pennsieve (University of Pennsylvania)
repository-code: https://github.com/pennsieve-apps/st-svg
license: Apache-2.0
keywords:
- spatial-transcriptomics
- transcriptomics
- genomics
- single-cell
- visium
- xenium
- merscope
- cosmx
- spatially-variable-genes
- spatial-statistics
